@backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5211

### Health
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/health

### Current development user
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/me

### Conversations
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/conversations

### Create a conversation
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/conversations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Monday planning"
}

### Tasks
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/tasks

### Create a task
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Buy groceries",
  "description": "Pick up groceries after work",
  "priority": "Normal",
  "estimatedMinutes": 30
}

### Commitments
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/commitments

### Planning context
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/planning-context

### Today's plan
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/plans/2026-09-21
